00:08:32.277 --> 00:08:35.713
Electroneg atom.

00:08:40.118 --> 00:08:41.620
Atom.

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:43.922
So what that means
is that if I draw--

00:08:43.922 --> 00:08:45.757
so if I draw my oxygen levels--

00:08:45.757 --> 00:08:46.892
but you know this, right?

00:08:46.892 --> 00:08:49.928
You know this, also,
