00:11:46.371 --> 00:11:49.441
It's the electron
configuration of the MOs,

00:11:49.441 --> 00:11:51.677
just like we would write
the s, p, d electron

00:11:51.677 --> 00:11:55.580
configuration of that,
but this is a molecule.

00:11:55.580 --> 00:11:57.716
Now, sometimes you
might, you know--

00:11:57.716 --> 00:11:59.551
say there's a
convention we use, which

00:11:59.551 --> 00:12:03.288
