Yeah, Snapchat.

00:40:11.174 --> 00:40:11.708
Yeah.

00:40:11.708 --> 00:40:12.175
OK.

00:40:12.175 --> 00:40:13.009
Thank you.

00:40:13.009 --> 00:40:14.277
You can't Snapchat on that.

00:40:14.277 --> 00:40:16.913
That's what I meant.

00:40:16.913 --> 00:40:19.082
I know it's not My
