00:40:25.188 --> 00:40:28.024
at membranes today as a
material scientist and materials

00:40:28.024 --> 00:40:30.026
chemists, all of your
membranes, I think,

00:40:30.026 --> 00:40:31.661
that's what it looks like.

00:40:31.661 --> 00:40:32.195
Why?

00:40:32.195 --> 00:40:33.397
Doesn't have to be the case.

00:40:33.397 --> 00:40:35.832
We can do so much better.

00:40:35.832 --> 00:40:36.933
And so-- OK.

00:40:36.933 --> 00:40:39.102
Energy costs goes into
