00:44:56.559 --> 00:44:57.827
BeH2.

00:44:57.827 --> 00:45:03.199
Well, Be, Be starts with an un--

00:45:06.002 --> 00:45:07.937
can I raise this up?

00:45:07.937 --> 00:45:11.708
Be starts with
orbitals that don't

00:45:11.708 --> 00:45:15.111
